@startuml buzzer_classification_en
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Buzzer" as BUZZER

package "Technology: how sound is produced" as TECHNOLOGY {
  rectangle "Piezoelectric\nDeformation of a ceramic element" as PIEZO
  rectangle "Magnetic\nCoil, magnetic field, and diaphragm" as MAGNETIC
}

package "Drive method: who creates the oscillation" as DRIVE {
  rectangle "Active indicator\nInternal oscillator" as ACTIVE
  rectangle "Passive transducer\nExternal signal" as PASSIVE
}

BUZZER --> TECHNOLOGY
BUZZER --> DRIVE
TECHNOLOGY --> PIEZO
TECHNOLOGY --> MAGNETIC
DRIVE --> ACTIVE
DRIVE --> PASSIVE

note bottom of BUZZER
  The two axes are independent:
  the technology does not
  automatically determine the drive.
end note
@enduml
